---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ResponsiveImage from '../components/ResponsiveImage.astro';
import EditorialFolio from '../components/EditorialFolio.astro';
import EditorialProblemMap from '../components/EditorialProblemMap.astro';
import EditorialArticleRow from '../components/EditorialArticleRow.astro';
import EditorialEvidenceTrack from '../components/EditorialEvidenceTrack.astro';
import ContactLinks from '../components/ContactLinks.astro';
import { getActiveServices, getPublishedArticles, getVisibleProducts } from '../lib/content';
const articles = await getPublishedArticles();
const tools = await getVisibleProducts();
const services = await getActiveServices();
const featuredArticle = articles[0];
const supportingArticles = articles.slice(1, 4);
const heroSchema = {'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Person',name:'Светлана Тарасова',jobTitle:'Основатель и практик',url:Astro.site ? new URL('/about/', Astro.site).href : undefined};
---
<BaseLayout title="Докрути — практические решения для бизнеса" description="Статьи, инструменты и практические решения для задач продаж, ассортимента, клиентов, команды, управления, маркетинга и ИИ." image="/hero-dokruti-editorial.png" schema={heroSchema} heroPreload={true}>
  <article class="brand-route brand-route--home">
    <section class="home-route">
      <div class="container home-route__grid">
        <EditorialFolio number="01" label="Home" />
        <div class="home-route__copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Разбираем реальные задачи малого бизнеса</p>
          <h1>Найти, что мешает бизнесу работать лучше. <em>И докрутить до понятного решения.</em></h1>
          <p class="home-route__lead">Статьи, инструменты и практические решения для задач продаж, ассортимента, клиентов, команды, управления, маркетинга и ИИ.</p>
          <a class="button button--primary" href="/contacts/" data-analytics-event="click_contact" data-analytics-placement="home_hero">Найти решение <i class="ti ti-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
        </div>
        <figure class="home-route__image"><ResponsiveImage src="/images/cnt-0026-plan-stop.png" alt="Рабочая тетрадь с проверкой причины" width={1200} height={800} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 43vw" /><figcaption>Рабочий след · факт → проверка → действие</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
      <div class="container home-route__map"><EditorialProblemMap /></div>
    </section>
    <section class="route-screen route-screen--library" id="library">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="route-screen__title"><div><EditorialFolio number="02" label="Library preview" /><h2>Сначала увидеть причину.<br /><em>Потом выбрать действие.</em></h2></div><p>Разборы рабочих ситуаций, в которых важно начать с наблюдаемого факта и одной следующей проверки.</p></div>
        {featuredArticle && <div class="home-feature"><EditorialArticleRow article={featuredArticle} featured placement="home_feature" /></div>}
        <div class="home-article-rows">{supportingArticles.map((article, index) => <EditorialArticleRow article={article} rank={index + 1} placement="home_supporting" />)}</div>
        <a class="route-link" href="/articles/">Открыть всю библиотеку <i class="ti ti-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <EditorialEvidenceTrack id="home-evidence" />
    <section class="route-screen route-screen--tools" id="tools">
      <div class="container tool-route">
        <div class="tool-route__copy"><EditorialFolio number="05" label="Tools" /><p class="eyebrow">Инструменты</p><h2>Проверить проблему на данных.</h2><p>Продукт не обещает ответ заранее. Сначала — рабочие материалы, статус и понятный следующий шаг.</p>{tools[0] && <a class="route-link route-link--light" href={'/tools/' + tools[0].data.slug + '/'} data-analytics-event="click_product" data-analytics-content-id={tools[0].data.id} data-analytics-placement="home_tool">Открыть досье инструмента <i class="ti ti-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>}</div>
        {tools[0] && <figure class="tool-route__image"><ResponsiveImage src={tools[0].data.cover} alt={tools[0].data.coverAlt} width={1200} height={800} loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 47vw" /><figcaption>{tools[0].data.status === 'HOLD' ? 'В подготовке · не продаётся' : tools[0].data.status}</figcaption></figure>}
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="route-screen route-screen--services" id="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="route-screen__title"><div><EditorialFolio number="06" label="Services" /><h2>Формат под задачу.</h2></div><p>Сначала описание ситуации и оценка fit. Затем — формат, срок и стоимость.</p></div>
        <div class="service-route-list">{services.map((service, index) => <article><span>0{index + 1}</span><div><h3>{service.data.title}</h3><p>{service.data.description}</p></div><a class="route-link" href="/services/" data-analytics-event="click_service" data-analytics-content-id={service.data.id} data-analytics-placement="home_services">Описать задачу <i class="ti ti-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></article>)}</div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="route-screen route-screen--about" id="about">
      <div class="container about-route"><div><EditorialFolio number="07" label="About" /><p class="eyebrow">Для кого мы делаем «Докрути»</p><blockquote>Светлана Тарасова — практик, эксперт и основатель.</blockquote><p>Многолетний опыт в торговле, управлении и рабочих процессах помогает смотреть на всю последовательность, которая приводит к результату.</p><a class="route-link" href="/about/">Познакомиться <i class="ti ti-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div><figure><ResponsiveImage src="/images/about-editorial-workspace.png" alt="Рабочая схема проекта «Докрути» на столе" width={1200} height={800} loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 55vw" /><figcaption>Работа начинается с наблюдения, данных и точного вопроса.</figcaption></figure></div>
    </section>
    <section class="route-screen route-screen--contact" id="contact"><div class="container contact-route"><EditorialFolio number="07" label="Contact" dark /><p class="eyebrow">Если готового материала нет</p><h2>Опишите задачу.</h2><p>Выберите активный канал — без собственной lead-form. Я предложу формат, срок и стоимость до начала работы.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contacts/" data-analytics-event="click_contact" data-analytics-placement="home_contact">Выбрать канал <i class="ti ti-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a><ContactLinks type="contacts" compact placement="home_contact_channels" /></div></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .brand-route{color:var(--c-graphite);background:#fff}.home-route{padding:1.4rem 0 clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem);background:var(--c-paper)}.home-route__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:74px minmax(0,1.02fr) minmax(280px,.78fr);grid-template-rows:auto auto;gap:1rem 2rem}.home-route__grid>.editorial-folio{grid-column:1/-1}.home-route__copy{grid-column:2;grid-row:2;align-self:center;padding:2.4rem 0}.home-route h1{max-width:720px;margin:.5rem 0 1.2rem;font-size:clamp(3.2rem,5.3vw,5.9rem);line-height:.91;letter-spacing:-.05em}.home-route h1 em,.route-screen h2 em{color:var(--c-orange);font-style:normal}.home-route__lead{max-width:520px;color:#56616a;line-height:1.55}.home-route__copy .button{margin-top:.6rem}.home-route__image{position:relative;grid-column:3;grid-row:2;margin:0;min-height:420px;border-left:3px solid var(--c-orange);background:#dfe5e9}.home-route__image img{height:100%;object-fit:cover}.home-route__image figcaption{position:absolute;right:.7rem;bottom:.7rem;padding:.3rem .45rem;background:#17130fcc;color:#fff;font-size:.68rem}.home-route__grid>.editorial-problem-map{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:3;margin-top:2rem}.home-route__grid>.editorial-problem-map .editorial-problem-map__rows{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);border-left:1px solid var(--c-graphite)}.home-route__grid>.editorial-problem-map .editorial-problem-map__row{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr 20px;gap:.55rem;min-height:150px;padding:.8rem;border-right:1px solid var(--c-graphite)}.home-route__grid>.editorial-problem-map .editorial-problem-map__row>b{text-align:left}.route-screen{padding:clamp(4rem,8vw,8rem) 0}.route-screen--library{background:#fff}.route-screen__title{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,8vw,8rem);align-items:end;margin-bottom:2rem}.route-screen__title h2{max-width:650px;margin:.7rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,5rem);line-height:.93;letter-spacing:-.045em}.route-screen__title>p{max-width:470px;margin:0;color:#56616a;line-height:1.55}.home-feature{margin-top:1.5rem}.home-article-rows{margin-top:1rem}.route-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;margin-top:1.2rem;color:inherit;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.route-link:hover{color:var(--c-orange)}.route-screen--tools{background:var(--c-chocolate);color:#fff}.tool-route{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.08fr;gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,7rem);align-items:center}.tool-route__copy{max-width:520px}.tool-route__copy>.editorial-folio{margin-bottom:2rem}.tool-route__copy h2{margin:.4rem 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5vw,5rem);line-height:.93}.tool-route__copy>p:not(.eyebrow){color:#d5d1cc;line-height:1.55}.route-link--light{color:#fff}.tool-route__image{position:relative;margin:0;border-top:2px solid var(--c-orange)}.tool-route__image img{aspect-ratio:1.35;object-fit:cover}.tool-route__image figcaption{position:absolute;left:.8rem;bottom:.8rem;padding:.35rem .5rem;background:#17130fcc;color:#fff;font-size:.7rem}.route-screen--services{background:var(--c-paper)}.service-route-list{border-top:2px solid var(--c-graphite)}.service-route-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:1.5rem;align-items:start;padding:1.35rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--c-graphite)}.service-route-list article>span{color:var(--c-orange);font:600 1.8rem/.9 var(--font-editorial)}.service-route-list h3{margin:0 0 .35rem;font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.5vw,2.35rem)}.service-route-list p{max-width:610px;margin:0;color:#56616a}.service-route-list .route-link{margin-top:.1rem;white-space:nowrap}.route-screen--about{background:#fff}.about-route{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,8vw,8rem);align-items:center}.about-route blockquote{max-width:560px;margin:1.2rem 0;font:600 clamp(1.8rem,3.2vw,3.2rem)/.98 var(--font-editorial)}.about-route p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:540px;color:#56616a;line-height:1.55}.about-route figure{margin:0}.about-route figure img{aspect-ratio:1.45;object-fit:cover}.about-route figcaption{margin-top:.5rem;color:var(--c-muted);font-size:.72rem}.route-screen--contact{background:var(--c-navy);color:#fff}.contact-route{max-width:850px}.contact-route>.editorial-folio{margin-bottom:2.5rem}.contact-route h2{margin:.4rem 0 .8rem;font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem);line-height:.9}.contact-route>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:520px;color:#e2e8ef;line-height:1.55}.contact-route .button{margin-top:1rem}.contact-route .contact-groups{margin-top:3rem}.contact-route .contact-groups h2,.contact-route .contact-groups .group-kicker{display:none}.contact-route .link-list a{border-color:#ffffff40;background:transparent;color:#fff;border-radius:0}.contact-route .link-list i{background:var(--c-orange)}@media(max-width:900px){.home-route__grid{grid-template-columns:52px minmax(0,1fr) minmax(220px,.8fr);gap:1rem}.home-route__grid>.editorial-problem-map .editorial-problem-map__rows{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.home-route__grid>.editorial-problem-map .editorial-problem-map__row:nth-child(n+5){border-top:1px solid var(--c-graphite)}.tool-route,.about-route{gap:2rem}}@media(max-width:700px){.home-route{padding-top:.7rem}.home-route__grid{display:block}.home-route__grid>.editorial-folio{margin-bottom:2rem}.home-route__copy{padding:0}.home-route h1{font-size:clamp(2.9rem,12vw,4.3rem)}.home-route__image{min-height:290px;margin-top:2rem}.home-route__grid>.editorial-problem-map{margin-top:3rem}.home-route__grid>.editorial-problem-map .editorial-problem-map__rows{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.home-route__grid>.editorial-problem-map .editorial-problem-map__row:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--c-graphite)}.route-screen__title{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.route-screen__title h2{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,11vw,4rem)}.tool-route,.about-route{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tool-route__copy>.editorial-folio{margin-bottom:1.5rem}.tool-route__image{order:-1}.service-route-list article{grid-template-columns:42px minmax(0,1fr);gap:.8rem}.service-route-list .route-link{grid-column:2}.about-route blockquote{font-size:2rem}.contact-route .link-list{display:grid}.contact-route .link-list a{width:100%}}
</style>
<style is:global>
  .brand-route--home .about-route figure picture{display:block;height:100%;min-height:260px}.brand-route--home .about-route figure picture img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:260px;object-fit:cover}
</style>
<style>
  .home-route__map{margin-top:2rem}.home-route__map .editorial-problem-map__rows{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);border-left:1px solid var(--c-graphite)}.home-route__map .editorial-problem-map__row{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr 20px;gap:.55rem;min-height:150px;padding:.8rem;border-right:1px solid var(--c-graphite)}.home-route__map .editorial-problem-map__row>b{text-align:left}.about-route figure{margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-rows:minmax(260px,1fr) auto;min-height:300px}.about-route figure :global(picture){min-height:260px}.about-route figure img{min-height:260px}
  @media(max-width:900px){.home-route__map .editorial-problem-map__rows{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.home-route__map .editorial-problem-map__row:nth-child(n+5){border-top:1px solid var(--c-graphite)}}
  @media(max-width:700px){.home-route__map{margin-top:3rem}.home-route__map .editorial-problem-map__rows{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.home-route__map .editorial-problem-map__row:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--c-graphite)}}
</style>
